.TH start-cli-backup-history-list 1  "list "
.SH NAME
start\-cli\-backup\-history\-list \- List past backups and their reports, newest first
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstart\-cli backup history list\fR [\fB\-\-offset\fR] [\fB\-\-limit\fR] [\fB\-\-format\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
List past backups and their reports, newest first
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-offset\fR \fI<OFFSET>\fR [default: 0]
Number of most recent backups to skip
.TP
\fB\-\-limit\fR \fI<LIMIT>\fR [default: 10]
Maximum number of backups to return
.TP
\fB\-\-format\fR

.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
